 preferences-desktop-theme.svg; and from
 Papirus/16x16/symbolic/status, system-software-update-symbolic.svg is
 software-update-available-symbolic.svg. Renamed and shipped in hicolor so
 that the Screenshot, Record Screen and Desktop Theme entries keep their
 icons under any icon theme, and so that a tray item asking for a name
 Papirus lacks (Ubuntu's unattended-upgrades) still finds one.

